<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: psychic insanity lance -->
  <Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.label>lança psíquica de loucura</Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.label>
  <!-- EN: A limited-use psychic effector. It overwhelms the target's mind with terrifying perceptual distortions, driving them into a berserk state. There is a risk of brain damage. It has a long range, but requires line of sight. -->
  <Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.description>Um efetor psíquico de uso limitado. Sobrecarrega a mente do alvo com distorções percetivas aterradoras, que o levam a um estado de fúria. Existe o risco de dano cerebral. Tem um longo alcance, mas requer linha de visão.</Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.description>
  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>carga</Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>em recarga</Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: psychic insanity lance -->
  <Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.verbs.psychic_insanity_lance.label>lança psíquica de loucura</Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.verbs.psychic_insanity_lance.label>
  <!-- EN: psychic insanity immune -->
  <Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.verbs.psychic_insanity_lance.invalidTargetPawn>imune à loucura psíquica</Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.verbs.psychic_insanity_lance.invalidTargetPawn>
  
  <!-- EN: psychic shock lance -->
  <Apparel_PsychicShockLance.label>lança de choque psíquico</Apparel_PsychicShockLance.label>
  <!-- EN: A limited-use psychic effector. It shocks the target's mind with chaotic images, blocking coherent perception and dropping them into a state of psychic shock. There is a risk of brain damage. It has a long range, but requires line of sight. -->
  <Apparel_PsychicShockLance.description>Um efetor psíquico de uso limitado. Atinge a mente do alvo com imagens caóticas, bloqueia a perceção coerente e deixa-o em estado de choque psíquico. Existe o risco de dano cerebral. Tem um longo alcance, mas requer linha de visão.</Apparel_PsychicShockLance.description>
  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <Apparel_PsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>carga</Apparel_PsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <Apparel_PsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>em recarga</Apparel_PsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: psychic shock lance -->
  <Apparel_PsychicShockLance.verbs.psychic_shock_lance.label>lança de choque psíquico</Apparel_PsychicShockLance.verbs.psychic_shock_lance.label>
  <!-- EN: psychic shock immune -->
  <Apparel_PsychicShockLance.verbs.psychic_shock_lance.invalidTargetPawn>imune ao choque psíquico</Apparel_PsychicShockLance.verbs.psychic_shock_lance.invalidTargetPawn>
  
